Third-party 3D models in hardware/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The KiCad projects under hardware/ include 3D models of off-the-shelf components
(files under 3D_Models/ and Libraries/, e.g. *.step, *.stl, *.wrl and the
*.snapshot.N folders) that were downloaded from component vendors and CAD
sharing sites. They are NOT covered by CERN-OHL-S-2.0; each remains under its
original author's terms. See hardware/README.md for their origin and terms.
